Description: Magni robot description package for ROS2 Jazzy
 This package provides the robot description, launch files, and configuration
 for the Magni robot in ROS2 Jazzy. It includes URDF models, Gazebo worlds,
 navigation configurations, and launch files for simulation and real robot
 operation.
 .
 The package is built and installed system-wide during installation.

